 11	/* ============================================================================
 12	   Mission Control HUD — a glass overlay floating over the 3D floor canvas
 13	   (mounted only in the 3D view from src/app/floor/page.tsx; the existing
 14	   ActivityTicker stays the guaranteed 2D/low-tier fallback).
 15	
 16	   Every tile is a live read of the REAL store — never a theatrical
 17	   incrementer:
 18	     Sourced   = candidates.length                    (useCandidates)
 19	     Contacted = ledger entries with status "sent"     (useLedger)
 20	     Drafted   = outreach messages ever generated      (useOutreach)
 21	     Approved  = outreach messages with approvedBy set (useOutreach)
 22	     Booked    = booking records                       (useBookings)
 23	   `useCountUp` (src/components/reveal/use-count-up.ts) animates old -> new
 24	   whenever a real value changes. The agent-events bus only decides *when* to
 25	   re-check for a delta (within one tick of the emitting store action, same
 26	   guarantee as the 1.2 floor FX) and feeds the throughput sparkline — it
 27	   never supplies the numbers themselves, so the HUD can never drift from
 28	   true state.
 29	   ========================================================================== */
